# PASS witness for gates/ecap_060_evidence_unbound_to_subject.rq: an evidence claim
# bound to its exact subject by a 64-lowercase-hex SHA-256 digest.
@prefix ecap: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/evidence-capability#> .
@prefix aps: <https://w3id.org/chatman/aps#> .
@prefix ex: <https://example.test/ecap/> .

ex:ev a ecap:EvidenceClaim ;
    ecap:subjectDigest "dddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddd" ;
    ecap:standing aps:PARTIAL_ALIVE .
